yle=feature:poi.business|visibility:off&amp;key=AIzaSyBE52SEkphsHpOvAjX7wVec5DYqnKo6DWo&amp;signature=qaoulYdFwSBSrF1w2XbC_u47Nj0="/></picture><div class="sc-7ed99987-1 cvlVLe"><div class="sc-98d92c22-0 lmZMJm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1000 410" height="12.8" width="32" class="sc-4158b40f-0 iOQqNO"><title>Sixt HQ</title><path d="M1000,64.3486862v84.5219345h-95.2709351v252.7862091h-99.5255127V148.8706207h-74.5170898 l-65.0908813,92.5158997l127.5218506,160.2667694H669.3632202l-69.3630371-94.046936l-72.9190063,94.046936l-213.0421143,0.00354 V190.5054321h97.5005188v203.3267822l125.5004578-152.445694l-51.6677246-63.997345 c7.6235046-2.5435333,16.0619202-5.8243561,23.2832642-8.8723755 c23.7313232-10.0188751,44.5698853-25.2941437,63.2211914-40.5835037l28.1234131,40.1813431l75.8929443-103.7659531H1000z M134.3661499,410c97.6028442-0.440979,161.247345-30.2647705,161.247345-110.5075073 c0-143.5592499-199.9646301-82.3382568-199.9646301-138.7579498c0-19.3815918,21.1101761-27.1850281,52.5779114-27.1850281 c38.5479431,0,88.2718964,12.9645538,126.8304138,25.4528809v-81.449234 C243.035614,68.3632965,197.4109497,57.910511,147.9374847,57.910511c-111.4317169,0-147.8100891,52.4192009-147.937088,109.1599121 c-0.3210258,144.0284271,196.6414948,82.6945648,196.6414948,138.6450653c0,18.8383179-20.8843994,27.3014221-62.6779022,27.3331909 c-41.137352,0-85.1145477-9.9836121-130.2947083-24.8884583v81.4316101C28.4518681,399.6565552,67.6136551,410,134.3661499,410" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M392.2088318,78.2566071c-22.76474,2.9633179-53.3857727,2.9492111-78.1648254,2.7375565 v81.8302383h46.2702332c63.235321,0,216.3617249-13.6207428,262.1486511-162.8244019h-97.69104 C495.9676514,56.7865753,446.7869873,71.2751541,392.2088318,78.2566071" fill="currentColor" class="sc-4158b40f-1"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-3f11572e-0 dzPGeU"><h2 class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP sc-d2042127-0 bibxRb">Additional Information</h2><div><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 lipaZZ sc-d2042127-2 ivrjTm">Your way to SIXT</h3><div class="sc-15970aff-0 gYtvnA sc-d2042127-3 hsZnJi">From Terminal 1, after collecting any baggage, follow the &quot;Car rental center&quot; signs. Our SIXT branch is located in Terminal 1 at the Munich Airport Center. From Terminal 2, after collecting any baggage, proceed to the ground floor, following the signs to Terminal 1. Walk through the open-air plaza, following the &quot;Car rental center&quot; signs to Terminal 1. Our SIXT branch is located in Terminal 1 at the Munich Airport Center.</div></div><div><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 lipaZZ sc-d2042127-2 ivrjTm">Diamond Lounge</h3><div class="sc-15970aff-0 gYtvnA sc-d2042127-3 hsZnJi">Our Diamond Lounge is located in the open-air plaza between Terminals 1 and 2. From Terminal 1, after collecting any baggage, proceed to the ground floor. Exit the building, following the signs for Terminal 2. When you arrive at the plaza, our Diamond Lounge will be on your left-hand side in the middle.  
From Terminal 2, after collecting any baggage, proceed to the ground floor. Exit the building, following the signs for Terminal 1. When you arrive at the plaza, our Diamond Lounge will be on your right-hand side in the middle.</div></div><div><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 lipaZZ sc-d2042127-2 ivrjTm">Return information</h3><div class="sc-15970aff-0 gYtvnA sc-d2042127-3 hsZnJi">Navigate to our SIXT branch at Terminalstr. Mitte/MWZ, Mietwagenzentrum, 85356 Munich. 
Once you arrive at the airport, follow the &quot;Mietwagenrückgabe / Rental Car Return&quot; signs to the return area located in the P6 parking garage. 
Once you arrive in the garage, park your vehicle in the designated SIXT return area. After checking that you have all your belongings with you, a service agent will collect the key or you can leave it in the vehicle. Returns are possible 24 hours a day.</div></div><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 lipaZZ sc-d2042127-2 ivrjTm"> Directions</h3><div class="sc-15970aff-0 gYtvnA sc-d2042127-3 hsZnJi">48.353919982910156, 11.7872896194458</div></div><h2 class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm sc-d2042127-0 bibxRb">Munich Airport</h2><div class="sc-d2042127-8 ecLTwP"><span class="sc-18bfb7c-2 sc-18bfb7c-3 sc-18bfb7c-4 iqZBWd gwMsqY bUPQzW sc-d2042127-9 ihGVLQ"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fDyEfN sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO sc-18bfb7c-1 dNJssd"></span><span class="sc-15970aff-0 bBrSYn sc-18bfb7c-0 cvbWkA">24h Return</span></span></div><div class="sc-b0f07eb3-0 sc-b0f07eb3-1 WfBRE emyrHG"><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo kiruUA sc-d2042127-7 jciLVG" offset=""><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm">Address</h3><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">Mietwagenzentrum Terminalstr. Mitte/MWZ, München, Bayern 85356, Germany</div><button class="sc-bf2492ad-3 sc-bf2492ad-4 ixrbKY sc-d9fcc1b5-0 iigeEU" kind="primary" type="button"><span class="sc-bf2492ad-1 iodUzc"><span class="sc-15970aff-0 lipaZZ">More information</span></span></button></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo kiruUA sc-d2042127-7 jciLVG" offset=""><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm">Business hours</h3><div class="sc-5e15fb4a-0 EUjPY"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ sc-5e15fb4a-1 dHNhib">Mon - Sun</div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ sc-5e15fb4a-2 gyLZsZ">05:00 - 00:00</div></div><div class="sc-5e15fb4a-0 iVkDWB"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ sc-5e15fb4a-1 dHNhib">Public Holidays</div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ sc-5e15fb4a-2 gyLZsZ">05:00 - 00:00</div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo hStgSc sc-d2042127-7 jciLVG" offset=""><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm">Out of hours</h3><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">Do you want to return your vehicle outside of opening hours?</div><button class="sc-bf2492ad-3 sc-bf2492ad-4 ixrbKY sc-d9fcc1b5-0 iigeEU" kind="primary" type="button"><span class="sc-bf2492ad-1 iodUzc"><span class="sc-15970aff-0 lipaZZ">Out-Of-Hours Conditions</span></span></button></div></div></div><div id="fleet_slider-v2-trigger-area"></div><div id="fleetslider_root"></div><section class="sc-d235a0e4-0 gMZvqL"><div class="sc-cac815e3-0 llJsiv sc-40fcd52b-0 kdWCJM"><div class="sc-b0f07eb3-0 sc-b0f07eb3-1 WfBRE emyrHG"><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo bDREHU sc-2818994d-0 cMnDCM" offset=""><div class="sc-2818994d-1 joQArp"><div class="sc-2818994d-2 kYVelR"><div></div><div class="sc-2818994d-3 ilziJN"><span class="sc-18bfb7c-2 sc-18bfb7c-3 iqZBWd fVCDRM sc-2818994d-4 eHtgbN"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fDyEfN sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO sc-18bfb7c-1 dNJssd"></span><span class="sc-15970aff-0 bBrSYn sc-18bfb7c-0 cvbWkA">4.6</span></span></div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 fYXCwI">Our customers love us</div></div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">4.6 stars from 29,643 reviews at Munich Airport.</div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo bDREHU sc-2818994d-0 cMnDCM" offset=""><div class="sc-2818994d-1 joQArp"><div class="sc-2818994d-2 kYVelR"><div></div><div class="sc-2818994d-3 ilziJN"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 hWuHwd sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 fYXCwI">Flexible returns</div></div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">Don&#x27;t worry when you bring your car back with 24hr returns.</div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo bDREHU sc-2818994d-0 cMnDCM" offset=""><div class="sc-2818994d-1 joQArp"><div class="sc-2818994d-2 kYVelR"><div></div><div class="sc-2818994d-3 ilziJN"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 hWuHwd sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 fYXCwI">Drive Luxury</div></div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">Rent one of our top luxury models at our Munich Airport branch.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sc-d235a0e4-0 gaxZBz"><div class="sc-cac815e3-0 llJsiv sc-40fcd52b-0 kdWCJM"><div class="sc-40fcd52b-1 khIsFx"><h2 class="sc-15970aff-0 lmYUov">Our services at Munich Airport</h2></div><div class="sc-b0f07eb3-0 sc-b0f07eb3-1 WfBRE emyrHG"><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo eqLcBS sc-3e6dd84e-0 iyQGVu" offset=""><div><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm sc-e4235883-1 dWRPeo">Welcome to SIXT at Munich Airport</h3><div class="sc-e4235883-2 hmJflH"><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="100" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-8f26e573-2 hInAW"><p>Greetings from SIXT at Munich Airport (MUC), where renting a car isn’t just a task – it’s an experience. Whether you’re visiting Munich for business or embarking on a <a href="https://www.sixt.com/magazine/road-trips/road-trip-on-the-german-alpine-road/" class="sc-72c5a7a4-0 eIVjPX">road trip along the famed German Alpine Road</a>, we’re here for you every step of the way.</p><p>Since 1912, we’ve provided top-of-the-line vehicles at prices everyone can afford. From compact sedans to spacious SUVs, our collection of premium vehicles will satisfy the pickiest driver. If you’re traveling with family, take a look at our multi-seat station wagons. If you want an electric vehicle with extended charge, we’ll set you up with the perfect sedan.</p><p>At SIXT, we put you in control of the rental experience. That’s why we let you select the add-ons that fit your needs. You can choose from a variety of protection plans that give you peace of mind or request comfort features like heated seats or a parking aid to help you back into tight spots.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo eqLcBS sc-3e6dd84e-0 gFZAc" offset=""><div><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm sc-e4235883-1 dWRPeo">Enjoy Munich in a SIXT rental car from Munich Airport</h3><div class="sc-e4235883-2 hmJflH"><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="100" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-8f26e573-2 hInAW"><p>From the second you look through our vehicle collection to the moment you give back the keys, your satisfaction is our priority. We believe renting a car should be easy. And, with SIXT, it always is.</p><h4 class="sc-15970aff-0 jXwAOY sc-8f26e573-0 eBzvGY">Before you rent</h4><ul role="list" class="sc-cf8fe82b-0 gXyYES sc-8f26e573-3 ePQwHS"><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><a href="https://www.sixt.com/app/" class="sc-72c5a7a4-0 eIVjPX">Get the App:</a> The SIXT app is your go-to place for everything you need to know about your booking.</div></li><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>Requirements:</strong> Don’t forget your passport or ID card and a credit card in your name. Some foreign nationals require an International Driver’s Permit so make sure you check before booking.</div></li></ul><h4 class="sc-15970aff-0 jXwAOY sc-8f26e573-0 eBzvGY">During your rental</h4><ul role="list" class="sc-cf8fe82b-0 gXyYES sc-8f26e573-3 ePQwHS"><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>You’re Right:</strong> In Germany, people drive on the right-hand side of the road.</div></li><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>The Autobahn:</strong> Although sections of the Autobahn do not have a speed limit, we recommend driving under 130 km/h (81 mph) and paying close attention to the road conditions.</div></li><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>City Speeds:</strong> The speed limit in Munich is 50 km/h (31 mph), but most people drive slower.</div></li></ul><h4 class="sc-15970aff-0 jXwAOY sc-8f26e573-0 eBzvGY">After you rent</h4><ul role="list" class="sc-cf8fe82b-0 gXyYES sc-8f26e573-3 ePQwHS"><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>Refuel:</strong> Several service stations can be found near the airport, but we also provide a refueling add-on.</div></li></ul><p><strong>Car return:</strong> Please return your vehicle at the following address <strong>Terminalstr. Mitte, 85356 München.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo eqLcBS sc-3e6dd84e-0 hsAxEy" offset=""><div><h3 class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm sc-e4235883-1 dWRPeo">Get to know SIXT car rental at Munich Airport</h3><div class="sc-e4235883-2 hmJflH"><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="100" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-8f26e573-2 hInAW"><p>We take pride in our customer service and go the extra mile (kilometer) to ensure you have the best experience possible. Here are a few ways we take the stress out of your journey:</p><ul role="list" class="sc-cf8fe82b-0 gXyYES sc-8f26e573-3 ePQwHS"><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>Protection Plans:</strong> From personal accident protection to third party protection, we let you choose the <a href="https://www.sixt.com/help-center/sections/protection/" class="sc-72c5a7a4-0 eIVjPX">protection plan</a> that gives you peace of mind.</div></li><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>Drive with Friends:</strong> You can include multiple additional drivers for a flat rate fee.</div></li><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>Luxury Life:</strong> We offer a variety of luxury cars from brands including Maserati, BMW, and Mercedes-Benz.</div></li><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>Diamond Status:</strong> Purchase our Diamond upgrade and relax in the Diamond Lounge at Munich Airport.</div></li><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>Get the Guide:</strong> We have some of the top tips about the <a href="https://www.sixt.com/magazine/travel/best-small-towns-near-munich/" class="sc-72c5a7a4-0 eIVjPX">best small towns outside of Munich</a> in our guide.</div></li><li kind="primary" class="sc-1d792370-1 JZpsU"><div><strong>Flexible Returns:</strong> Don’t worry if your plans change – you can return the car at any time to an authorized SIXT location. Just let us know in advance.</div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b0f07eb3-0 sc-b0f07eb3-1 WfBRE emyrHG sc-3e6dd84e-1 TDwjT"><div offset="" class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo lPPJQ"><div class="sc-3e6dd84e-2 bipPQw"><button class="sc-bf2492ad-3 sc-bf2492ad-4 ixrbKY sc-d9fcc1b5-0 jydRav" kind="primary" type="button"><span class="sc-bf2492ad-2 cKsJLA"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fkxyWl sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></span><span class="sc-bf2492ad-1 iodUzc"><span class="sc-15970aff-0 lipaZZ">Show more</span></span></button></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sc-d235a0e4-0 bYHUHI"><div class="sc-cac815e3-0 llJsiv sc-40fcd52b-0 kdWCJM"><div class="sc-40fcd52b-1 khIsFx"><h2 class="sc-ef2897e9-0 kMNsSj">Customer reviews &amp; feedback</h2></div><div><div class="sc-2a0493da-0 bhCVdr"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 ijaKUV">4.6</div><div class="sc-2a0493da-1 dsNxEb"><div class="sc-3f11572e-0 dzPGeU">4.5656857</div><div class="sc-47f8509-0 htSBr"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 sc-14127c93-1 hRwmoZ hzJCNQ sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 sc-14127c93-1 hRwmoZ hzJCNQ sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 sc-14127c93-1 hRwmoZ hzJCNQ sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 sc-14127c93-1 hRwmoZ hzJCNQ sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 sc-14127c93-1 hRwmoZ hzJCNQ sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 huMFDp">Based on 29643 reviews</div></div></div><div class="sc-15970aff-0 fahrfv sc-2a0493da-2 kujfWA">from our Customer Excitement Score survey*</div><div class="sc-76617f87-1 fZoAIc"><p class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm sc-76617f87-0 cwyplo">What our customers are saying</p><div class="sc-76617f87-2 dprhPI"><div class="sc-c5bb9963-0 bvVqed"><div class="sc-c5bb9963-3 cKapiB"><div class="sc-c5bb9963-4 epHNBf"><div class="sc-76617f87-3 kfyHJZ"><header class="sc-76617f87-4 cYOKCx"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 hQQTJq sc-76617f87-5 fXyrSE">4.9</div><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fkxyWl sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></header><footer class="sc-76617f87-7 jmJVjN"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 fYXCwI sc-76617f87-6 hqBHLi">Vehicle handover</div></footer></div><div class="sc-76617f87-3 kfyHJZ"><header class="sc-76617f87-4 cYOKCx"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 hQQTJq sc-76617f87-5 fXyrSE">4.7</div><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fkxyWl sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></header><footer class="sc-76617f87-7 jmJVjN"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 fYXCwI sc-76617f87-6 hqBHLi">The way to SIXT</div></footer></div><div class="sc-76617f87-3 kfyHJZ"><header class="sc-76617f87-4 cYOKCx"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 hQQTJq sc-76617f87-5 fXyrSE">4.6</div><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fkxyWl sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></header><footer class="sc-76617f87-7 jmJVjN"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 fYXCwI sc-76617f87-6 hqBHLi">Vehicle return</div></footer></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-44ec678f-0 gsuNjM"><div class="sc-b0f07eb3-0 sc-b0f07eb3-1 WfBRE hbaoom"><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo dVBJyy sc-3e6dd84e-0 iyQGVu" offset=""><div class="sc-d235a0e4-0 eWAeZA sc-44ec678f-1 jCdAmG"><div class="sc-44ec678f-2 gLElEj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">Raymond T.</div><div class="sc-44ec678f-3 jnCBHw"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 huMFDp">5.0</div><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 sc-14127c93-1 fkxyWl hzJCNQ sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></div></div><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="100" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">Recommend renting from SIXT without hesitation. Staff was extremely helpful and efficient during the pickup and drop off process. Quality, selection and condition of their vehicles is top tier.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo dVBJyy sc-3e6dd84e-0 hsAxEy" offset=""><div class="sc-d235a0e4-0 eWAeZA sc-44ec678f-1 jCdAmG"><div class="sc-44ec678f-2 gLElEj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">Krzysiek O.</div><div class="sc-44ec678f-3 jnCBHw"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 huMFDp">5.0</div><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 sc-14127c93-1 fkxyWl hzJCNQ sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></div></div><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="100" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">Nice and quick service, friendly staff (actually the guy who took care of me today, was a helluva joker, very funny 😂). They have here pretty big variety of available cars and brands, from low level, over medium, to top notch expensive ones. I&#x27;ve decided to give it a try and drive Cupra for the very first time. Nice and really comfortable car. 🚘😎👍🏻</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo dVBJyy sc-3e6dd84e-0 hsAxEy" offset=""><div class="sc-d235a0e4-0 eWAeZA sc-44ec678f-1 cYRRoO"><div class="sc-44ec678f-2 gLElEj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">Pratt R.</div><div class="sc-44ec678f-3 jnCBHw"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 huMFDp">5.0</div><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 sc-14127c93-1 fkxyWl hzJCNQ sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></div></div><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="100" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">Megan &amp; Fatiha are fantastic!</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b0f07eb3-0 sc-b0f07eb3-1 WfBRE emyrHG sc-3e6dd84e-1 TDwjT"><div offset="" class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo lPPJQ"><div class="sc-3e6dd84e-2 bipPQw"><button class="sc-bf2492ad-3 sc-bf2492ad-4 ixrbKY sc-d9fcc1b5-0 jydRav" kind="primary" type="button"><span class="sc-bf2492ad-2 cKsJLA"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fkxyWl sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></span><span class="sc-bf2492ad-1 iodUzc"><span class="sc-15970aff-0 lipaZZ">See all reviews</span></span></button></div></div></div></div><p class="sc-15970aff-0 jqNFcY sc-9f699b78-1 hnrxcA">*Our Customer Excitement Score is based on a survey sent to all customers who booked at Munich Airport. The score is an average of all customer responses.</p></div></div></section><div><section class="sc-d235a0e4-0 imYOJP sc-1ff198c4-0 ecvcDH"><picture><source media="(min-width: 900px)" srcSet="https://img.sixt.com/1200/2797f9df-6d80-499b-b564-00a520d6a2b8.jpg 1200w, https://img.sixt.com/1400/2797f9df-6d80-499b-b564-00a520d6a2b8.jpg 1400w, https://img.sixt.com/1600/2797f9df-6d80-499b-b564-00a520d6a2b8.jpg 1600w, https://img.sixt.com/2800/2797f9df-6d80-499b-b564-00a520d6a2b8.jpg 2800w, https://img.sixt.com/3200/2797f9df-6d80-499b-b564-00a520d6a2b8.jpg 3200w" sizes="100vw"/><img class="sc-1ff198c4-1 cJmpLw" alt="" decoding="async" sizes="100vw" src="https://img.sixt.com/1600/2797f9df-6d80-499b-b564-00a520d6a2b8.jpg" srcSet="https://img.sixt.com/100/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 100w, https://img.sixt.com/200/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 200w, https://img.sixt.com/300/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 300w, https://img.sixt.com/400/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 400w, https://img.sixt.com/600/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 600w, https://img.sixt.com/800/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 800w, https://img.sixt.com/1200/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 1200w, https://img.sixt.com/1400/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 1400w, https://img.sixt.com/1600/1e570827-b290-4ec2-868e-1f4550bef429.jpg 1600w"/></picture><div class="sc-cac815e3-0 llJsiv"><h2 class="sc-15970aff-0 lmYUov sc-1ff198c4-2 bjabTz">Good to know when renting at Munich Airport</h2><div class="sc-b0f07eb3-0 sc-b0f07eb3-1 WfBRE emyrHG"><div class="sc-c5bb9963-0 bvVqed"><div class="sc-c5bb9963-3 cKapiB"><div class="sc-c5bb9963-4 kwwobM"><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo eqLcBS sc-1ff198c4-3 ejGXyk" offset=""><div class="sc-d235a0e4-0 gaxZBz sc-1ff198c4-4 eYJeJN"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">What&#x27;s the minimum age to rent a car at Munich Airport?</div><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="150" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">To rent a car with SIXT at Munich Airport you need to be at least 18 with a valid license. Some car categories have a higher minimum rental age, and an underage driver fee may apply.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo eqLcBS sc-1ff198c4-3 ejGXyk" offset=""><div class="sc-d235a0e4-0 gaxZBz sc-1ff198c4-4 eYJeJN"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">Can I modify, extend, or cancel my reservation?</div><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="150" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">You can modify, extend, or cancel your reservation in Munich Airport through your manage booking section or through the app.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b326b7d1-0 sc-b326b7d1-1 jcxAfo eqLcBS sc-1ff198c4-3 ejGXyk" offset=""><div class="sc-d235a0e4-0 gaxZBz sc-1ff198c4-4 eYJeJN"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 CTaUP">What documents do I need to rent a car at Munich Airport?</div><div class="sc-b4496db0-0 jIOWTZ"><div height="150" class="sc-b4496db0-1 rqTsS"><div class="sc-b4496db0-2 inEPGj"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">You will need a full, valid driver&#x27;s license along with a passport or identity card when picking up your car. More detailed information can be found in our rental information. These rules vary from country to country so please always check local regulations before making your travel arrangements.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><section class="sc-d235a0e4-0 gMZvqL"><div class="sc-cac815e3-0 llJsiv sc-40fcd52b-0 kdWCJM"><div class="sc-a6df7d1c-0 fdIrxA"><button aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="36ec63cf2e92ca3d65223c581f605323" id="acc_head_36ec63cf2e92ca3d65223c581f605323" class="sc-e76557d9-0 fAKXys"><div class="sc-e76557d9-2 lnscTN"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 fSYjbm">Can I book a long-term car rental at Munich Airport?</div></div><div class="sc-e76557d9-3 loiNSp"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fkxyWl sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></div></button><div id="36ec63cf2e92ca3d65223c581f605323" role="region" aria-labelledby="acc_head_36ec63cf2e92ca3d65223c581f605323" class="sc-f356cfc4-0 iNpXOi"><div class="sc-f356cfc4-1 gMWFtg"><div class="sc-a6df7d1c-1 fgLxxV"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">Easily book a long-term rental at Munich Airport by entering trip dates and pickup/drop-off locations.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-a6df7d1c-0 fdIrxA"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="5005e88edaee8a3e013db8dc7985bc37" id="acc_head_5005e88edaee8a3e013db8dc7985bc37" class="sc-e76557d9-0 fAKXys"><div class="sc-e76557d9-2 lnscTN"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 vrhXz">Do I need to purchase insurance or protection packages with my rental at Munich Airport?</div></div><div class="sc-e76557d9-3 loiNSp"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-14127c93-0 fkxyWl sc-75c8e486-0 cjQYxO"></span></div></button><div hidden="" id="5005e88edaee8a3e013db8dc7985bc37" role="region" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="acc_head_5005e88edaee8a3e013db8dc7985bc37" class="sc-f356cfc4-0 iNpXOi"><div class="sc-f356cfc4-1 gMWFtg"><div class="sc-a6df7d1c-1 fgLxxV"><div class="sc-15970aff-0 bmMXLJ">It is not required to do so. However, you are able to purchase a range of protection packages and insurances to reduce your liability.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-a6df7d1c-0 fdIrxA"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="0cd8